"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":351,"closed_issues":2337,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:17:38Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-30T20:25:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:03:51Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T18:03:51Z","assignee":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nRegression between 4.2 and 4.3.\nThere were many PRs related to duplication in that period.\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you have an instance of a scene and you move a child inside that instance, and then duplicate it, the children's properties will get mixed up. Looks like `duplicate()` uses only node's index to assign properties, so if the indices were shuffled, the properties are not assigned properly.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create instance of a scene\n2. Modify the instance at runtime by using `move_child()`\n3. Duplicate the instance in code\n4. Compare the instance with its duplicate\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[broken_dupen.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22626577/broken_dupen.zip)\n\nThe Instance scene has a ColorRect and a Control with red modulate. Main modifies the child order, then creates and adds a duplicate. The duplicate's ColorRect ends up red. Commenting out `move_child()` will make the rectangle have correct color.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https